  {
    "change": "Change 6: the generic \"How students from India save in Boston\" tips are gone; deals come only from approved official sources.",
    "from": "<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px\">\n<h3 class=\"d\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 30px\">General tips</h3>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1.5px solid var(--ink); margin-top: 14px\"><div style=\"padding: 24px 28px 0 0px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Live further out on the T</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Rent usually drops away from the campus core. Many students share in Allston, Brighton or Somerville and take the train in.</span><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C9CBFA\"></span>Housing</span></div><div style=\"padding: 24px 28px 0 28px; border-left: 1px solid #DCDDE3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Plan around 1 September</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Most Boston leases start on 1 September. Students moving out often give away furniture that week, so wait before buying.</span><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C9CBFA\"></span>Housing</span></div><div style=\"padding: 24px 28px 0 28px; border-left: 1px solid #DCDDE3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Cook together, shop in bulk</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Splitting rice, dal and spices with flatmates goes much further than eating out.</span><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DDFF7A\"></span>Living costs</span></div><div style=\"padding: 24px 28px 0 28px; border-left: 1px solid #DCDDE3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Send fewer, larger transfers</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #4A4B63\">Each transfer has fees, and banks often add a markup to the rate. Compare against the mid-market rate before you send.</span><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--move)\"></span>Moving money</span></div></div>\n</div>\n",
    "to": ""
  },
