=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>Getting around</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">11% off</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">MBTA Semester Pass</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Discounted T passes, bought through participating schools. Ask your student affairs or transport office.</span>\n<a href=\"https://mbta.getanchor.io/fares/college-student-semester-passes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: MBTA pass programme</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Getting around\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #9FEADA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3.5\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 16L10.5 9H15L17 16M9.5 7H12\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>Getting around</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">Cheaper bikes</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Bluebikes, through your school</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Many schools, including BU and Tufts, offer discounted Bluebikes memberships. The price depends on your school.</span>\n<a href=\"https://www.bu.edu/transportation/bicycling/bluebikes-discount/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: BU Transportation</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Museums\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #C9CBFA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9L12 4L20 9M6 10V17M10 10V17M14 10V17M18 10V17M4 20H20\" stroke=\"#14151F\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>Museums</span>\n<span class=\"d\" style=\"margin-top: 6px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1\">Free entry</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3\">Museum of Fine Arts</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4A4B63\">Free admission with student ID if your school is in the MFA University Membership Program.</span>\n<a href=\"https://mfa.org/programs/college-programs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"margin-top: auto; padding-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: #4A4B63\">Source: mfa.org</a>\n</article><article class=\"deal\" data-cat=\"Museums\" style=\"border-radius: 24px; background: #FFFFFF; padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #4A4B63\"><span style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 11px; background: #C9CBFA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9L12 